          "path": "_m/s/g/p/0/saada-wp/river-of-sand-down-the-centre-.jpg",
          "filename": "River of sand down the centre of the village (13386700203).jpg",
          "caption": "\"We went to Kitaf in the far west of Sadah bordering the Rhub el Khali. It is an area where there are few aid organisations present because of a history of insecurity. We were there to see our nutrition projects and see how we could work with the government health services to improve the quality of programming and supervision.\" (Original description from Flickr); foto album title on Flickr: \"Schools and nutrition in Sadah\"",
